OL,3,GNEWSAWhy 'cool kids' won't let Swindon
OL,4,Ain Thames Valley
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you have ever been picked last for a
OL,7,Fsports team, or not invited to a party,
OL,8,Fyou might know how the Borough of
OL,9,FSwindon feels right now.
OL,11,FThe government wants district and
OL,12,Fborough councils to be scrapped to make
OL,13,Fway for larger combined authorities,
OL,14,Fmany of which will be run by mayors.
OL,16,FThe issue for Swindon, however, is that
OL,17,Fsome of the council leaders in
OL,18,FBerkshire and Oxfordshire do not want
OL,19,FSwindon to join them in a Thames Valley
OL,20,Fauthority, arguing the geography does
OL,21,Fnot work.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
