OL,3,GNEWSAWhy 'cool kids' won't let Swindon
OL,4,Ain Thames Valley
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwindon Borough Council leader Gary
OL,7,FSumner said: "It's like not being
OL,8,Finvited to the party with the popular
OL,9,Fkids."
